{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07654","headline":"古意二首 一 · 贺兰进明","name":"古意二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦庭初指鹿，羣盗满山东。\n忤意皆诛死，所言谁肯忠。\n武关犹未啓，兵入望夷宫。\n爲祟非泾水，人君道自穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰进明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}